 "short_description": "<ul>\n<li>High-Performance Architecture: Powered by the NVIDIA® GeForce® RTX 2060 SUPER&#x2122; with 2176 CUDA cores and a 1650 MHz boost clock for exceptional 1080p and 1440p gaming performance.</li>\n<li>Rapid Memory Interface: Equipped with 8GB of GDDR6 VRAM across a 256-bit memory bus operating at 14 Gbps for fast texture streaming and multitasking.</li>\n<li>Versatile Display Outputs: Features three DisplayPort 1.4a ports and one HDMI&#x2122; 2.0b port supporting multi-monitor setups and resolutions up to 7680&#215;4320.</li>\n<li>Compact &amp; Efficient Build: Designed with a dual-fan cooling layout measuring 231mm in length, requiring a single 8-pin power connector and a 550W recommended PSU for wide case compatibility.</li>\n</ul>",
 "description": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://rbtechngames.com/product-category/computers/graphic-cards/\">MSI GeForce RTX 2060 Super Ventus 8GB Graphics Card</a></h1>\n<div style=\"font-family: &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;max-width: 100%;margin: 15px 0;border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;border-collapse: collapse;background-color: #ffffff;font-size: 13px;text-align: left\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #0f172a;border-bottom: 1px solid #0f172a\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px 14px;font-size: 13px;font-weight: 600;color: #ffffff;text-transform: uppercase;letter-spacing: 0.5px;width: 1%;white-space: nowrap\">Specification Group</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px 14px;font-size: 13px;font-weight: 600;color: #ffffff;text-transform: uppercase;letter-spacing: 0.5px\">MSI GeForce® RTX 2060 SUPER VENTUS Details</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><!-- GPU Specifications --></p>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #f8fafc;border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;font-weight: 600;color: #1e293b;width: 1%;white-space: nowrap;vertical-align: top\">GPU Specifications</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;color: #334155;line-height: 1.5\"><strong>Model Name:</strong> GeForce® RTX 2060 SUPER VENTUS<br />\n<strong>Graphics Processing Unit:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® RTX 2060 SUPER&#x2122;<br />\n<strong>Interface:</strong> PCI Express x16 3.0<br />\n<strong>Core Clocks:</strong> Boost: 1650 MHz<br />\n<strong>CUDA® Cores:</strong> 2176 Units<br />\n<strong>DirectX Version Support:</strong> 12 API<br />\n<strong>OpenGL Version Support:</strong> 4.5<br />\n<strong>Maximum Displays:</strong> 4</td>\n</tr>\n<p><!-- Memory Specs --></p>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;font-weight: 600;color: #1e293b;width: 1%;white-space: nowrap;vertical-align: top\">Memory Specs</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;color: #334155;line-height: 1.5\"><strong>Memory:</strong> 8GB GDDR6<br />\n<strong>Memory Speed:</strong> 14 Gbps<br />\n<strong>Memory Bus:</strong> 256-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<p><!-- Display Outputs &amp; Resolution --></p>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #f8fafc;border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;font-weight: 600;color: #1e293b;width: 1%;white-space: nowrap;vertical-align: top\">Display &amp; Outputs</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;color: #334155;line-height: 1.5\"><strong>Output:</strong><br />\n&#8211; DisplayPort x 3 (v1.4a)<br />\n&#8211; HDMI&#x2122; x 1 (Supports 4K@60Hz as specified in HDMI&#x2122; 2.0b)<br />\n<strong>HDCP Support:</strong> 2.2<br />\n<strong>Digital Maximum Resolution:</strong> 7680&#215;4320</td>\n</tr>\n<p><!-- Power &amp; Physical Dimensions --></p>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;font-weight: 600;color: #1e293b;width: 1%;white-space: nowrap;vertical-align: top\">Power &amp; Dimensions</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;color: #334155;line-height: 1.5\"><strong>Power Consumption:</strong> 175 W<br />\n<strong>Power Connectors:</strong> 8-pin x 1<br />\n<strong>Recommended PSU:</strong> 550 W<br />\n<strong>Card Dimension:</strong> 231 x 128 x 42 mm<br />\n<strong>Weight (Card / Package):</strong> 758 g / 1198 g</td>\n</tr>\n<p><!-- Technologies &amp; Features --></p>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;font-weight: 600;color: #1e293b;width: 1%;white-space: nowrap;vertical-align: top\">Technologies &amp; Features</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 14px;color: #334155;line-height: 1.5\"><strong>VR Ready:</strong> Yes<br />\n<strong>G-SYNC® Technology:</strong> Yes<br />\n<strong>Adaptive Vertical Sync:</strong> Yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://www.msi.com/Graphics-Card/GeForce-RTX-2060-SUPER-VENTUS/Specification\">Link to official product page</a></p>",
